## Con vật

```csharp
AnimalData : ScriptableObject
  string animalName
  float moveSpeed
  IMoveBehavior moveBehavior   // Strategy

// IMoveBehavior implementations
WalkBehavior   — bò
HopBehavior    — gà
WaddleBehavior — vịt

// StateMachine states
IdleState → WalkingState → EatingState → SleepingState
```

---

## NPC

```csharp
NPCData : ScriptableObject
  string npcName
  Sprite portrait
  DialogueLine[] dialogues
  ScheduleEntry[] schedule     // time → location → action

// Save data
int relationshipLevel
bool[] storyFlags

// StateMachine states
IdleState → WalkingState → WorkingState → TalkingState → SleepingState
```

---

## Story System

```csharp
StoryData : ScriptableObject
  StoryStep[] steps

StoryStep : ScriptableObject   // abstract
  UniTask Execute(StoryContext ctx)

// Implementations
DialogueStep      — show dialogue, await player click
GiveItemStep      — add item to inventory
WaitForActionStep — await EventBus event (eventName, matchValue, count)
FadeScreenStep    — fade in/out

// Runner
async UniTask Play(StoryData story) {
    foreach (var step in story.steps)
        await step.Execute(ctx);
}
```

---

## Quest System

```csharp
QuestData : ScriptableObject
  QuestStepData[] steps

QuestStepData : ScriptableObject
  string eventToListen   // "OnTreeChopped"
  string matchValue      // "" = bất kỳ
  int requiredCount

// QuestSystem lắng nghe tất cả events
// match → tăng progress → đủ count → advance step
```

