## Folder Structure

```
_Game/Scripts/
├── Installers/         — GameCtrl, FarmSceneCtrl
├── Config/             — CropData, AnimalData, NPCData, StoryData, QuestData
├── Systems/            — TimeSystem, InventorySystem, CropSystem, AnimalSystem, NPCSystem, StorySystem, QuestSystem
├── States/
│   ├── Crop/
│   ├── Animal/
│   └── NPC/
├── Strategy/
│   └── MoveBehavior/
├── Story/
│   └── Steps/
└── Views/              — CropView, AnimalView, NPCView
```
